 as they can so I focus on whatever  medium you find easiest so you know if  you'd like blogging if you're really  great at typing and creating great  content go with the blog if you're you  know not that great at typing but you  still want to get involved in the  written language then you go with no  Twitter if you're really great a video  it on YouTube combine all of them if you  can but try to start building the  following try to add a lot of value add  information so people want to follow you  they want to learn more about  you and the more likely to then sign up  and take that next step with you instead  of just having that static page so I  hope that helps I hope you can follow  some of those steps and get out of that  nine months slump and start building a  business for everybody else if you  enjoyed the video please give it a  thumbs up and we'll create more of them  and love to hear it constant feedback if  you want to leave a comment below and  stay tuned for the next episode  you  you
 

